{
  "context": "Split build and deploy jobs. PR validation is read-only. Only the protected publication push or trusted dispatch may enter the github-pages environment and obtain Pages write/OIDC permissions. Post-deploy verification probes receipts, digests, routes, range reads, docs, Explorer, and corpus identity. Failure automatically rolls forward to the retained known-good artifact, verifies recovery, freezes promotion, and opens an incident.",
  "description": "Deploy a byte-equivalent or intentionally no-op assembled artifact through the new protected path while the old release deploy remains available. Verify production, then perform and verify a rollback drill to the retained last-known-good successful deployment. Do not release the promotion lock until verification or rollback finishes.",
  "legacy": {
